# X-Gate · On-Chain Micropayment API Gateway

# Project Context
项目名: xGate
One-liner: 给任意API做付费网关 + AI Agent 自主决策是否付费 + CROO CAP 集成
方向: AI 支付 · CROO Agent Hackathon

核心场景:
- API 提供商: gateway/ 拦截流量，x402 402 收费
- AI 消费者: agent/ LLM 决策 pay/skip，stub 模式调 gateway
- CROO CAP: provider 接 negotiate → pay → LLM policy → deliver + receipt
- 链上审计: PaymentReceipt.sol — pay 和 skip 都写 receipt
- 实时仪表盘: web/ Live + Audit + CAP Orders

Packages（独立 npm，非 monorepo）:
- gateway/  — 反向代理 :8402 + admin :8403 + /cap-orders
- agent/    — LLM scenarios + croo:provider + croo:demo
- web/      — Next.js 15 三 Tab Dashboard

# Tech Stack
- TypeScript strict, tsx, viem v2, OpenAI SDK (DeepSeek)
- @croo-network/sdk — CAP order lifecycle
- Next.js 15, Tailwind v4, recharts
- Base Sepolia testnet, x402 protocol, stub verifier (gateway)

# Code Style
- 2-space indent; external I/O wrapped in try/catch + 1 retry
- No database — gateway store.ts in-memory; CAP log in gateway/data/cap-orders.json
- agent AGENT_DEMO_MODE=stub — fake X-Payment for gateway; CAP payOrder uses testnet USDC
- BASE_RPC_URL must be https://sepolia.base.org (never mainnet)

# Autonomy Red Lines
1. NEVER touch mainnet wallets or keys
2. NEVER commit .env — only .env.example
3. NEVER log WALLET_PRIVATE_KEY / GATEWAY_PRIVATE_KEY / CROO_SDK_KEY*
4. NEVER introduce Postgres/SQLite/Redis
5. agent pay cases use stub X-Payment unless explicitly switching to live

# CROO Week 1 (feat/croo-cap-minimal) — DONE
- croo/client.ts + provider.ts + requester-demo.ts
- policy.ts shared by scenarios + CAP provider
- Dashboard CAP Orders tab
- npm run croo:provider | croo:demo

# Week 2+ Plan
